> crit abs x
critical points of abs(x):
  abs(x)' = sign(x)
  x ≈ 0: local minimum, abs(x) = 0
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
> crit abs(x-1)
critical points of abs(x - 1):
  abs(x - 1)' = sign(x - 1)
  x ≈ 1: local minimum, abs(x - 1) = 0
