> crit min(x^2,x)
critical points of min(x^2, x):
  min(x^2, x)' = x^2 <= x ? 2x : 1
  x ≈ 0: stationary inflection, min(x^2, x) = 0
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
> crit (x<0 ? x^2 : -x^2)
critical points of x < 0 ? x^2 : -x^2:
